  {
    "description": "Change one thing on a record a result named (by its ref or position): one field per kind, through the button its page uses. The user confirms on a card that shows the change. The ref kinds here and their field: work-item (status); bot (paused); finding (status); job (reviewed or requeued); channel (member); dm (read).",
